{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Fool\u2019s Cup?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Kingdom of the Kingdom of Heart Boxers., only one title matters.<br> The Greatest Jester of the Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fool\u2019s Cup</strong> is an online multiplayer PVP party game set in a colorful medieval world, where jesters <strong>slap, shove, strike, and knock each other out</strong> in a chaotic tournament for the crown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/596b6a7aecb7d151a1a860a5e4d5f28b.poster.avif?t=1770635682\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/596b6a7aecb7d151a1a860a5e4d5f28b.webm?t=1770635682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/596b6a7aecb7d151a1a860a5e4d5f28b.mp4?t=1770635682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will <strong>slap, push, throw, and outplay other players</strong> to force them out of the arena or leave them stunned and defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes alliances form. <br>Sometimes it\u2019s every jester for themselves. <br><strong>But every round ends the same way: only one jester remains standing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/1b139dd641d841e4999b6d327b707d37.poster.avif?t=1770635682\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/1b139dd641d841e4999b6d327b707d37.webm?t=1770635682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/1b139dd641d841e4999b6d327b707d37.mp4?t=1770635682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer PVP combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slap-based physical attacks, brawling, and player elimination</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful medieval arenas filled with chaotic mini games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends or fight everyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable matches packed with fun and rivalry<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/37822d38231ee00211369cb61680da8f.poster.avif?t=1770635682\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/37822d38231ee00211369cb61680da8f.webm?t=1770635682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/37822d38231ee00211369cb61680da8f.mp4?t=1770635682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game about honor or glory. <br>It\u2019s about <strong>combat-driven chaos, dirty tricks, and slapping your friends out of the arena at the perfect moment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win by eliminating your rivals.</strong><br><strong>Claim the crown.</strong><br><strong>Become the kingdom\u2019s greatest fool.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/f0060bd1baa57bab8b30b9a4502f662c.poster.avif?t=1770635682\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/f0060bd1baa57bab8b30b9a4502f662c.webm?t=1770635682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/f0060bd1baa57bab8b30b9a4502f662c.mp4?t=1770635682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714560?t=1770635682","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714560?t=1770635682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/978d328e7297935bd5cb61f7e8b3f18aca9097ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770635682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/978d328e7297935bd5cb61f7e8b3f18aca9097ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770635682","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Fool\u2019s Cup?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Kingdom of the Kingdom of Heart Boxers., only one title matters.<br> The Greatest Jester of the Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fool\u2019s Cup</strong> is an online multiplayer PVP party game set in a colorful medieval world, where jesters <strong>slap, shove, strike, and knock each other out</strong> in a chaotic tournament for the crown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/596b6a7aecb7d151a1a860a5e4d5f28b.poster.avif?t=1770635682\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/596b6a7aecb7d151a1a860a5e4d5f28b.webm?t=1770635682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/596b6a7aecb7d151a1a860a5e4d5f28b.mp4?t=1770635682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will <strong>slap, push, throw, and outplay other players</strong> to force them out of the arena or leave them stunned and defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes alliances form. <br>Sometimes it\u2019s every jester for themselves. <br><strong>But every round ends the same way: only one jester remains standing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/1b139dd641d841e4999b6d327b707d37.poster.avif?t=1770635682\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/1b139dd641d841e4999b6d327b707d37.webm?t=1770635682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714560/extras/1b139dd641d841e499